sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    
    actor User
    participant RN as React Native App (Mobile)
    participant NextJS as Next.js Web App (WebView)
    participant API as Next.js API (Backend)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL Database
    participant MP as Mercado Pago
    participant FCM as Firebase Cloud Messaging

    Note over RN, NextJS: Token Registration Flow
    RN->>FCM: requestUserPermission() & getToken()
    FCM-->>RN: Returns fcmToken string
    RN->>NextJS: window.postMessage({ type: 'FCM_TOKEN', token })
    NextJS->>API: POST /api/settings/push-token { token }
    API->>DB: Upsert fcmToken into SiteSettings
    API-->>NextJS: 200 OK
    
    Note over MP, RN: Webhook & Notification Flow
    MP->>API: POST /api/mercadopago/webhook (Payment Approved)
    API->>DB: Query fcmTokens for the Site Owner
    DB-->>API: Returns [token1, token2]
    API->>FCM: admin.messaging().sendMulticast({ notification, tokens })
    FCM-->>API: Response (Success / Invalid Tokens)
    API->>DB: Purge invalid tokens (if any)
    FCM->>RN: Deliver Push Notification (Background/Foreground)
    RN->>User: Displays Alert or System Notification
